* text eol=lf

*.jpg   binary
*.png   binary
*.gif   binary
*.dll   binary
*.exe   binary
*.ttf   binary
# The canonical wire descriptor set. Without this, the catch-all "* text eol=lf" above rewrites line endings
# inside a serialized FileDescriptorSet and every checkout gets a file protobuf refuses to read.
*.desc  binary

*.cs diff=csharp
*.sln text eol=crlf
